WEBVTT

C01
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.700
Speaker A: At Café Lumière,
we keep the old signs.

C02
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.400
Speaker A: Do not crop the date
off the photograph.

C03
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.300
Speaker B: The date reads
[1908/1909?], I think.

C04
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Speaker A: Keep the uncropped
image too.

C05
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.200
Speaker A: It may help someone
check the lettering.

C06
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.600
Speaker B: Leave José’s note
in French.

C07
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.800
Speaker A: Oui, la façade
a changé.

